{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:MassEndomorphism.ChiV111ViaSignSubstitution","@type":"LeanModule","name":"MassEndomorphism.ChiV111ViaSignSubstitution","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":8,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_difference_at_one","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_difference_at_one","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v111-via-sign-substitution.lean#L105-L109","doc":"At `q = 1`: vanishes (isospin invariance). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_difference_at_two","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_difference_at_two","kind":"theorem","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v111-via-sign-substitution.lean#L98-L103","doc":"Numerical cross-check at `q = 2`:\nclosed form = -(5)²·3/(4·32) = -75/128. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_eq_chi_V3_div_q4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_eq_chi_V3_div_q4","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v111-via-sign-substitution.lean#L89-L96","doc":"**The conjugate-partition (sign-rep) symmetry**: V_(1,1,1)'s\nclosed form equals V_(3)'s closed form divided by `q^4`.\nThis is the structural reason the two share the same numerator\npolynomial `-(q²+1)²(q²-1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_closed_form_local","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V3_closed_form_local","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v111-via-sign-substitution.lean#L78-L86","doc":"The V_(3) closed-form expression (mirrored here for self-\ncontainment of the substitution lemma).\n\nDUPLICATION TRACKING: same as `chi_V3_difference_factored`\n(`rem:chi-v3-closed-form-proof`) and `chi_V3_diff_closed`\n(`rem:chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms`). Local copy\nkeeps the substitution lemma self-contained. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_difference_eq_factored","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_difference_eq_factored","kind":"theorem","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v111-via-sign-substitution.lean#L63-L70","doc":"**V_(1,1,1) closed-form derivation** (sign-rep on typed-B_3).\nClosed by `field_simp + ring` from the scalar arithmetic. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_difference_factored","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_difference_factored","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v111-via-sign-substitution.lean#L52-L59","doc":"The closed-form (factored) expression.\n\nDUPLICATION TRACKING: also defined as `chi_V111_diff_closed` in\n`rem:chi-per-irrep-cyclotomic-closed-forms`. Chapter-block\nisolation prevents direct cross-file import; centralisation\ndeferred per AGENTS.md convention. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_beta_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_beta_n","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v111-via-sign-substitution.lean#L45-L48","doc":"χ_(1,1,1)(β_n) on the neutron typed-B_3 braid\n(5σ + 4σ⁻¹ + 2 averaged). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_beta_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.chi_V111_beta_p","kind":"def","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/mass-endomorphism/chi-v111-via-sign-substitution.lean#L40-L43","doc":"χ_(1,1,1)(β_p) on the proton typed-B_3 braid\n(6σ + 3σ⁻¹ + 2 averaged). ","signatureChunk":0}]}